    "title": "Community group schedules meeting in City of Andover for Thursday, Aug. 27",
    "text": "Community group schedules meeting in City of Andover for Thursday, Aug. 27\nBy\nT. E. CristOn Thursday, Aug. 27, a community organization will host a Teen Advisory Board Meeting at the Andover Public Library in the City of Andover.\nThe session is set to begin at 5 p.m. at the Andover Public Library.\nCommunity members interested in attending are encouraged to participate and engage in local discussions.",
